QuestGuidance.Register("en",332,{
[10593]="700718A2\n1\tDefeat Adagím jackals (total: 10)\030Gather pack-leader pelts (total: 6)\tBaráil in Sâr Marsag asked that you travel to the Pits of Chortáth in the south-west and thin the number of jackals in the area. She also requested you gather pelts from the pack-leaders that they can use in the camp.\n2\tReturn to Baráil with the pelts\tReturn to Baráil in Sâr Marsag with the gathered pelts and inform her that you thinned the number of jackals threatening the camp.\n",
[10594]="700377EA\n1\tThe people of Entwade can be found throughout the settlement. Léoflad has sent you to gather the people of Entwade in hopes that they can soon depart for the Eastfold.\t\n2\tTalk to Léoflad\tLéoflad can be found near the waggons outside the Mead Hall of Entwade. You have spoken to numerous groups of people in Entwade and have sent them to gather at Léoflad's side. You should now speak to Léoflad and inform her that her people are ready.\n",
[10595]="70064295\n1\tPick up the summoning horn and call Lágsaith to your side\tLágsaith has begun her tale. You should pick up the summoning horn to call her to your side.\n2\tExplore the sewers and confront Gárvadach\tWith the heavy Angmarim presence in the sewers, Gárvadach cannot be far. NOTE: You can use the 'Call Lágsaith' skill to call Lágsaith to your side.\n3\tDefeat Gárvadach\tGárvadach has been discovered, and he is not happy about this untimely interruption. NOTE: You can use the 'Call Lágsaith' skill to call Lágsaith to your side.\n4\tExplore the sewers and confront Gárvadach (again)\tA heavily injured Gárvadach has fled deeper into the sewers. NOTE: You can use the 'Call Lágsaith' skill to call Lágsaith to your side.\n5\tDefeat Rádarríg\tGárvadach has met his demise at the hands of a... giant rat? It seems this \"king of rats\" will not stand for more trespassers! NOTE: You can use the 'Call Lágsaith' skill to call Lágsaith to your side.\n",
